  Slug: seneschal
  DisplayName: Seneschal
  IconPath: icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-horned-white-purple.webp
  Description: 'Your witch patron has gone mysteriously silent. You still have access
    to your abilities, and your familiar is still funneling your patron''s power
    to you. As you learn how to tap into that power, you influence your familiar
    to mold the power by itself, continuing to learn new spells and provide you with
    other witch class features. Without your patron watching over your power, you
    gain more control but also miss important lessons. You must select @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Seneschal
    Witch Dedication] as your 2nd-level class feat. Prerequisites: You must be a
    witch who has lost contact with your patron. Adjustments: Instead of your patron''s
    lesson, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Manifest Will] hex
    cantrip and your familiar learns one common 1st-rank spell of your choice from
    your spell list.'
